---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config/site';

// TODO-confirm: have the owner review this policy and name a Data Protection Officer.
const updated = 'September 28, 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | The Messy Kitchen"
  description="How The Messy Kitchen collects, uses and protects your personal data under the Philippine Data Privacy Act of 2012 (RA 10173)."
  crumbs={[{ name: 'Privacy Policy', path: '/privacy/' }]}
>
  <article class="container-site pt-8 md:pt-12">
    <header class="max-w-2xl">
      <p class="eyebrow">Last updated {updated}</p>
      <h1 class="display-1 mt-4">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="lede mt-5">
        We respect your privacy and handle your personal data in line with the Data Privacy Act of 2012 (Republic Act No.
        10173), its Implementing Rules and Regulations, and issuances of the National Privacy Commission (NPC).
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="prose-policy mt-12 max-w-2xl">
      <h2>Who we are</h2>
      <p>
        {SITE.name} ("we", "us") is a café and bakery in {SITE.city}, Philippines. We are the personal information
        controller for data collected through this website. Contact: <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>Only what you type into our forms:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Cake reservations:</strong> name, mobile number, optional email, the cake, quantity, pickup branch and date, dedication and notes.</li>
        <li><strong>Celebrations & corporate inquiries:</strong> name, optional company, mobile number, optional email, occasion, quantity, date, budget range, pickup branch or delivery address, and your message.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        This website does not use advertising or analytics cookies and does not track you across other sites. Our hosting
        provider keeps standard server logs (such as IP address and browser type) for security and to keep the site running.
      </p>

      <h2>Why we use it</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To confirm your reservation or inquiry, arrange payment, and prepare your order.</li>
        <li>To contact you by text, call or email about that order.</li>
        <li>To keep basic records of orders as required for our business and by law.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We do not sell your data or use it for marketing without asking you first.</p>

      <h2>Legal basis</h2>
      <p>
        We process your data based on your consent, which you give by ticking the box on our forms, and because it is
        necessary to fulfill the order you ask for (Sections 12(a) and 12(b), Data Privacy Act).
      </p>

      <h2>Who we share it with</h2>
      <p>Only with service providers that help us run this website, bound to protect your data:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Vercel</strong>, which hosts this website.</li>
        <li><strong>Resend</strong>, which delivers form submissions to our inbox by email.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>These providers may process data outside the Philippines. We share only what is needed to deliver your request.</p>

      <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
      <p>
        We keep reservation and inquiry details for up to one (1) year after your order is completed, unless a longer period
        is required by law (for example, tax records). After that, we delete or anonymize it.
      </p>

      <h2>How we protect it</h2>
      <p>
        Form data travels over an encrypted connection (HTTPS). Access to order emails is limited to staff who need it to
        prepare your order.
      </p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>Under the Data Privacy Act, you have the right to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>be informed about how your data is processed;</li>
        <li>access your data and get a copy of it;</li>
        <li>object to processing, and withdraw your consent;</li>
        <li>correct inaccurate or incomplete data;</li>
        <li>have your data blocked, removed or destroyed;</li>
        <li>data portability;</li>
        <li>claim damages for harm caused by inaccurate, incomplete, unlawfully obtained or unauthorized use of your data; and</li>
        <li>file a complaint with the National Privacy Commission (<a href="https://privacy.gov.ph" rel="noopener">privacy.gov.ph</a>).</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        To exercise any of these, email <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a> with the subject "Data Privacy
        Request". We will reply within fifteen (15) working days.
      </p>

      <h2>Data Protection Officer</h2>
      <p>
        For privacy questions or concerns, contact our Data Protection Officer at{' '}
        <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>We may update this policy from time to time. The date at the top shows the latest version.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .prose-policy :global(h2) {
    font-size: 1rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    margin-top: 2.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 400;
  }
  .prose-policy :global(p),
  .prose-policy :global(li) {
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }
  .prose-policy :global(p + p),
  .prose-policy :global(ul + p),
  .prose-policy :global(p + ul) {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
  }
  .prose-policy :global(ul) {
    list-style: disc;
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
  }
  .prose-policy :global(li + li) {
    margin-top: 0.35rem;
  }
  .prose-policy :global(strong) {
    color: var(--color-ink);
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .prose-policy :global(a) {
    color: var(--color-ink);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 0.2em;
  }
</style>
